==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Leafeon}}.
*'''Forest Breath''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-Power}} on {{TCG ID|Triumphant|Celebi|92}} from the {{TCG|Triumphant}} expansion.
*{{m|Solar Beam}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Leafeon}} can learn via [[TM]].

